WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.464 --> 00:00:14.520
Yes, even short hair can be styled into an updo with a skilled artist's technique and the help of hairpieces.

2
00:00:14.856 --> 00:00:21.288
But because short cuts often have many layers, the connection points can look awkward,

3
00:00:21.624 --> 00:00:29.736
so an advanced, detailed technique is needed — working strand by strand, creating waves, and setting them naturally.

4
00:00:30.072 --> 00:00:38.376
If the hair is a very short cut that's physically too short to blend, rather than forcing it up, we keep the cut style,

5
00:00:38.712 --> 00:00:47.688
and add volume at the crown so it looks like an updo when viewed from the front.

6
00:00:48.024 --> 00:00:57.408
If you want an updo, discuss the design possibilities with your artist during the pre-consultation.
